        "content_QbbHRd": {
          "type": "content",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Elevating Dining in Care Interiors",
            "title_size": "xl",
            "text": "<h4>Only found at Furncare </h4>\n\nUnique to Furncare, the Grayson range has been developed with a distinctive design language, defined by elegant detailing and a distinctive contemporary character.\n\n\n<h4>A refined design</h4>\n\nSoftly sculpted curved legs introduce a refined sense of sophistication, serving as a distinctive design feature while maintaining exceptional strength and stability, and reducing damage points. \n\n<h4>Contemporary finishes</h4>\n\nOffered in several handpicked finishes, allowing for greater design flexibility and creating a tailored feel while ensuring the piece sits beautifully alongside both classic and contemporary furniture.",
